---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Software engineer, dad and learner">
  <section class="page-intro" data-open-sky data-animate>
    <h1>About</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="text-block" data-animate style="--delay: 80ms">
    <p>
      A software engineer, navigating professional development, expanding
      horizons and being a dad. In love with the process.
    </p>
    <p>
      Consulting, traditional finance, FinTech, construction tech, startup,
      scaleup or enterprise. I have been there and even if decisions and
      approaches may differ, I truly believe the following is true:
    </p>
    <p>
      Enjoy what you do, own it, and stay curious. These principles do not just
      lead to a great career but, more importantly, to a great life.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you want to talk about work, software in general, or one of my
      projects, write to
      <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
